@startuml Login Flow
skinparam style strictuml

actor Browser
participant "Gateway\n/auth/login" as GW
database Redis
participant Keycloak

Browser -> GW: GET /api/v1/auth/login?return_to=/game
activate GW

GW -> GW: sanitizeReturnTo(return_to)
GW -> GW: state = uuid.New()
GW -> Redis: SetState(state, "/game")\nTTL = 5 min
Redis --> GW: OK

GW -> GW: Build Keycloak auth URL\nclient_id, redirect_uri,\nresponse_type=code, scope=openid, state

Browser <-- GW: 302 Redirect → Keycloak /auth
deactivate GW

Browser -> Keycloak: GET /realms/{realm}/protocol/openid-connect/auth?...
activate Keycloak
Keycloak --> Browser: Login page (gordle theme)
Browser -> Keycloak: POST credentials
Keycloak --> Browser: 302 Redirect → /api/v1/auth/callback?code=...&state=...
deactivate Keycloak

@enduml
